From eb4d326c7bd16d30a9dafa42edf1bd0203984074 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 17:05:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: 405 Bad Guys Parlays icon text + Cash App $Tique +
 build fix

- Add "405 BAD GUYS" (gold) and "PARLAYS" (neon green) text overlay
  to all Jack app icons (1024, 512, 192, 180, maskable-512)
- Update Cash App payment flow to use $Tique cashtag link instead of
  Cash App Pools (not available to commissioner)
- Admin instructions now guide setting up a direct $cashtag URL
- Player-facing payment buttons say "Send $20" with clear 3-step flow
- Fix Unicode smart quotes that broke the Vite/esbuild build
